herolte: bench compares the governor with a fixed rate in one boot (0474)

min105 and min107 (E-0326, E-0328): 1976 MHz is the best cap on three boots, but every measurement ran under governor v2 with a cap, never against a fixed rate. heroscenc digits above 5 now mean FIXED (the governor holds the cap instead of following the load): 8 = fixed 1976. The defaults need no argument: four rounds, paging and spotlight, caps 38 = governed 1976 against fixed 1976, alternating order. Fixed runs are labelled paging_fixed and spotlight_fixed. heroscen only.

